## 2026-08-05 — Buzzer loops until reset (post-milestone follow-up)
- limit_manager: one-time ring moved out of checkLimits; new updateBuzzer() runs every loop — while any channel is TRIPPED, beeps continuously (loops through every tripped channel's beep count, highest pattern then next, repeating) until no tripped channels remain. Guards with buzzer->isBusy() so patterns never restart mid-beep.
- buzzer: added stop() (IDLE + pin LOW). Called from resetCounter() and rolloverIfNeeded() for immediate silence.
